weekly-j includes Arc UI Free accordion, button, calendar, checkbox, date-picker,
dialog, input, popover, select, textarea, foundation, and motion token sources.
Source: https://uiarc.dev and https://github.com/kuratlielia/arc-library
Their MIT notice is retained at src/renderer/components/arc/LICENSE.
Arc source was formatted for this repository. Its theme and component styling
are retained, with component-scoped keyboard focus feedback, inert collapsed
accordion panels, and a portaled date-picker popup that fits the desktop window.

Runtime dependency licenses are supplied with the packaged dependencies and
Electron's LICENSES.chromium.html. No Arc Pro source is included.
